  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Central Continent is over fifty million kilometers wide, with extremely rich primeval energy, many sects, and plentiful human and natural resources.",
      "chapters": [
        334
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fei He Mountain sits in the southern part among tens of thousands of hills. It floats above a sea of cloud, carries ten thousand cranes famous in the region, and is the seat of Immortal Crane Sect.",
      "chapters": [
        334
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "geography",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_fei_he_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Gu Immortal meeting of that sect is also staged on Fei He mountain in Central Continent.",
      "chapters": [
        697
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "geography",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tian Ti is the mountain where the ten great sects send elite disciples to contest Fairy Bai Hu’s inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        335
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "geography",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_tian_ti",
        "inh_hu_immortal_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It also appears in Immortal Crane sect politics as the site of Hu Immortal inheritance and as stairs once connected to Heavenly Court.",
      "chapters": [
        407
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "geography",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hu Immortal blessed land is placed in Central Continent in the same inheritance talk.",
      "chapters": [
        337
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "geography",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Myriad Dragon Dock is one of the ten great ancient sects of Central Continent, like Immortal Crane Sect.",
      "chapters": [
        706
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-great-sects-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_myriad_dragon_dock",
        "fac_ten_great_ancient_sects"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Combat Immortal Sect is one of the ten great ancient sects.",
      "chapters": [
        712
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-great-sects-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_combat_immortal_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Black Heaven Temple is one of the ten great ancient sects; its Gu Immortals defend that reputation while hunting in Northern Plains.",
      "chapters": [
        811
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-great-sects-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_black_heaven_temple"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Spirit Affinity House is one of the ten great ancient sects of Central Continent, with deep foundation.",
      "chapters": [
        853
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-great-sects-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wind Cloud Manor is one of the ten great ancient sects of Central Continent; Hong Chi Ming from that sect is skilled in Gu formations.",
      "chapters": [
        923
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-great-sects-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_wind_cloud_manor",
        "char_hong_chi_ming",
        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Combat Immortal Sect’s disciple selection depends on combat results among candidates fighting for places.",
      "chapters": [
        1227
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-great-sects-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The organisational unit in this region is the sect. Immortal Crane Sect is one of the top ten sects in Central Continent,",
      "chapters": [
        334
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sects-rather-than-clans",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "acts with objectives of its own to seize Hu Immortal blessed land,",
      "chapters": [
        407
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sects-rather-than-clans",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "and holds Gu Immortal meetings among its supreme elders.",
      "chapters": [
        697
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sects-rather-than-clans",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Central Continent’s sect system differs from Southern Border’s clan system: clans sustain hierarchy through blood ties, while sects recruit disciples by talent and character.",
      "chapters": [
        335
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sects-rather-than-clans",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before going to Tian Ti mountain, Immortal Crane elites are told Heavenly Lotus Sect, Spirit Butterfly Valley, Ancient Soul Sect, Heaven’s Envy Sect, and the other Central Continent top ten sects will also contest Bai Hu’s inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        335
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sects-rather-than-clans",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect",
        "loc_spirit_butterfly_valley",
        "fac_ancient_soul_sect",
        "fac_heavens_envy_sect",
        "char_fairy_bai_hu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The ten great sects are the heads of Central Continent, and even Southern Border’s top clans cannot compare to them.",
      "chapters": [
        366
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sects-rather-than-clans",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "An overview of the set is Ten Great Sects.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sects-rather-than-clans",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_ten_great_sects"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earth Abyss lies in the far west of Central Continent as an enormous layered underground world. Ancient Soul Sect keeps its main headquarters there and treats the abyss as exclusive domain.",
      "chapters": [
        728
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "landmarks-and-sect-territories",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_earth_earth_abyss",
        "fac_ancient_soul_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Falling Heavenly River lies on Central Continent; Gu Immortals gather at its source riverbed.",
      "chapters": [
        959
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "landmarks-and-sect-territories",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_falling_heavenly_river"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Pool is the location of Heavenly Lotus Sect.",
      "chapters": [
        963
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "landmarks-and-sect-territories",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_heavenly_pool"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Lotus comes under attack in Central Continent’s north-east as Heavenly Lotus Sect.",
      "chapters": [
        997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "landmarks-and-sect-territories",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_heavenly_lotus"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Heavenly Lotus Sect in Central Continent, Heavenly Pool is a rank eight Immortal Gu House base created by Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        1000
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "landmarks-and-sect-territories",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court is the number one Gu Immortal organization in the world, present since the Remote Antiquity Era, and it looks down on all five regions.",
      "chapters": [
        1069
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "the-heavenly-court",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it publicizes the capture of Spectral Soul Demon Venerable, Gu Immortals across the five regions feel that shock.",
      "chapters": [
        1438
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "the-heavenly-court",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Early history sits on Remote Era.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "the-heavenly-court",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_era_remote"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Regional walls separate the five regions. Crossing one is a severe undertaking for Gu Immortals,",
      "chapters": [
        710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "the-regional-wall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "and a wall can be a place of ambush.",
      "chapters": [
        1216
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "the-regional-wall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Central Continent’s membrane is named the saint regional wall; beyond it toward Northern Plains sits the licorice regional wall.",
      "chapters": [
        710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
