    },
    {
      "text": "Central Continent Gu Immortals gather under Heavenly Court orders for a Northern Plains battle.",
      "chapters": [
        1233
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "regional-conflicts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Central Continent later sends Immortal Gu House reinforcements into that war outside its borders.",
      "chapters": [
        1267
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "regional-conflicts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The region later becomes the main setting in Chaos in Central Continent. Bai Ning Bing, Hei Lou Lan, and Ying Wu Xie attack with countless victories and throw Central Continent into chaos,",
      "chapters": [
        1704
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "regional-conflicts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_arc_central_continent_chaos",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_ying_wu_xie"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and the fighting reaches Emperor City, where Central Continent Immortal Gu Houses form layered defenses around the city.",
      "chapters": [
        1708
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "regional-conflicts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_emperor_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later declares every person in Central Continent his hostage after Star Constellation Immortal Venerable takes Qi Sea Ancestor into Heavenly Court.",
      "chapters": [
        2323
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "regional-conflicts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
        "char_qi_sea_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He then plunders Central Continent’s large resource points while Star Constellation Immortal Venerable stays in Heavenly Court, placing sites such as profound jade snake cave and Lake Heart Mountain into his sovereign immortal aperture, and shrinking Falling Heavenly River to sixty percent so that portion is stored there.",
      "chapters": [
        2325
      ],
